 "response": {
  "text": "Bilkul. **₹2,000 ke budget mein meri first choice Pepe Jeans aur Spykar** rahengi—sale mein inke achhe models mil rahe hain.\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men's Holborne Mid Rise Straight Jeans]()\n*₹1,359.15*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men Slim Blue Jeans]()\n*₹1,495.15*\n\n### [Spykar Men's Regular Fit Mid Rise Jeans]()\n*₹2,475*\n\n### [Snitch Men's Black Straight Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,799*\n\n### [H&M Denim Blue Relaxed Jeans]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Jack & Jones Clark Low Rise Regular Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,679*\n\n### Mere hisaab se ranking\n\n1. **🥇 Pepe Jeans — Best overall**  \n   ₹1,300–₹2,000 ke aas-paas sale mein mil rahe hain. Straight/slim fits aur denim quality generally achhi choice hai. Official site par abhi kuch models ₹1,499–₹1,999 range mein listed hain. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n2. **🥈 Spykar — Best Indian denim brand**  \n   Regular/slim fits ke kaafi options ₹1,300–₹1,900 mein mil rahe hain. Daily wear ke liye **Rover Regular Fit** particularly achha option hai. [spykar.com](https://spykar.com/collections/men-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n3. **🥉 Jack & Jones — Stylish option**  \n   Sale mein ₹1,500–₹2,000 ke andar mil jaye to definitely consider karo. Fit/styling thoda more fashionable hai.\n\n4. **H&M — Simple & modern**  \n   Agar **relaxed/straight fit** pasand hai, ₹1,999 ka option achha hai.\n\n5. **Snitch — Trendy look**  \n   ₹1,500–₹1,800 ke aas-paas stylish straight/black jeans mil sakti hain. Quality se zyada fashion priority ho to.\n\n### Agar sirf **ek** jeans leni ho:\n**Dark blue + straight/regular fit + mid-rise** lo. Ye T-shirt, shirt, polo aur sneakers—sabke saath easily chalegi.\n\n**Meri pick: Pepe Jeans ki dark-blue straight-fit ₹1,499 wali.** [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar tum mujhe **apni age, height, weight aur waist size** bata do, main tumhare body type ke hisaab se **₹2,000 ke andar 5 exact jeans** choose karke de sakta hoon.",
